{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AFK Companion - Stay Active, Stay Connected</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lightweight, cross-platform desktop utility that prevents automatic idle detection across games, applications, and communication platforms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Automation</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable intervals (0.5 second to 5 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal, invisible mouse movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Function keys (F13\u2013F20) toggle for instant control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse click on selected screen location or selected zone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple use case presets (Gaming, Work, Streaming)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own preset</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Button press selection for a-z and Enter/Space/Backspace</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Session Tracking</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time session monitoring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runtime and action counters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent statistics across restarts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Universal Compatibility</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-platform: Windows, macOS &amp; Linux</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System tray operation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Important!</strong>\u00a0Use this application responsibly and in accordance with the Terms of Service and Terms of Conditions of the applications or games you use it with. Misuse may result in account restrictions or bans.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 cla